# Risk Assessment and Responsible AI

| Risk | Mitigation |
|---|---|
| Incorrect AI classification | Human verification |
| Incorrect expiry extraction | Validate against original document |
| Missing information | Completeness checks |
| Sensitive data exposure | Secure storage and access controls |
| Over-reliance on AI | User training and human decision authority |
| Incorrect compliance decision | AI must not independently approve documents |

## Governance Principles

1. Human accountability.
2. Transparency of AI-generated suggestions.
3. Data minimization.
4. Access control.
5. Auditability.
6. Continuous monitoring.

All compliance and safety decisions remain with authorized personnel.
